WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.370
If your prep is MiraLAX, this video will walk you through exactly how to take

2
00:00:04.370 --> 00:00:05.200
it.

3
00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:07.380
Just follow along step by step.

4
00:00:07.380 --> 00:00:10.820
For this prep, you'll need a few items, all available over the counter, no

5
00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:11.560
prescription

6
00:00:11.560 --> 00:00:12.560
needed.

7
00:00:12.560 --> 00:00:17.290
You'll need one 238 gram bottle of Miralax powder, two to four Dulcolax lax

8
00:00:17.290 --> 00:00:18.400
ative tablets,

9
00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:23.400
and 64 ounces of a clear sports drink like Gatorade, Propel, or Crystal Light.

10
00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:25.680
That's usually two 32 ounce bottles.

11
00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:28.880
If you have diabetes, use sugar-free Gatorade G2.

12
00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:33.360
Also, make sure you get the laxative tablets, not the stool softener.

13
00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:38.040
One important rule, your sports drink cannot be red, orange, blue, or purple.

14
00:00:38.040 --> 00:00:40.680
Stick to clear or light-colored flavors.

15
00:00:40.680 --> 00:00:45.200
The day before your colonoscopy, you'll start by mixing the solution.

16
00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:48.870
Pour the entire bottle of MiraLAX into a pitcher with all 64 ounces of the

17
00:00:48.870 --> 00:00:50.280
sports drink.

18
00:00:50.280 --> 00:00:53.600
Stir or shake until the powder is completely dissolved.

19
00:00:53.600 --> 00:00:56.000
You can chill it in the refrigerator if you'd like.

20
00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:58.880
Keeping it cold makes it easier to drink.

21
00:00:58.880 --> 00:01:02.240
Now for part one, the evening before your procedure.

22
00:01:02.240 --> 00:01:05.840
At 5 p.m., take your Dulcolax tablets with a glass of water.

23
00:01:05.840 --> 00:01:09.560
Your doctor's instructions will tell you whether to take two or four.

24
00:01:09.560 --> 00:01:11.920
Follow their guidance on the specific amount.

25
00:01:11.920 --> 00:01:15.520
At 6 p.m., you'll start drinking the first half of the solution.

26
00:01:15.520 --> 00:01:17.120
That's 32 ounces.

27
00:01:17.120 --> 00:01:20.760
Drink an eight ounce glass every 15 minutes until that half is gone.

28
00:01:20.760 --> 00:01:23.240
Keep drinking clear liquids after you finish.

29
00:01:23.240 --> 00:01:27.420
For part two, six hours before your colonoscopy, you'll drink the second half

30
00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:28.080
which is another

31
00:01:28.080 --> 00:01:29.640
32 ounces.

32
00:01:29.640 --> 00:01:33.880
Drink this at the same pace: an eight-ounce glass every 15 minutes.

33
00:01:33.880 --> 00:01:37.480
You can continue to have clear liquids up until three hours before your

34
00:01:37.480 --> 00:01:38.200
procedure.

35
00:01:38.200 --> 00:01:39.980
This part is really important.

36
00:01:39.980 --> 00:01:43.580
You must drink all the prep solution as directed, even if you're already

37
00:01:43.580 --> 00:01:45.480
passing clear liquid.

38
00:01:45.480 --> 00:01:49.100
I know it can feel like enough, but finishing the entire dose is what gives us

39
00:01:49.100 --> 00:01:49.800
the clearest

40
00:01:49.800 --> 00:01:52.480
view during your procedure.

41
00:01:52.480 --> 00:01:56.200
If the prep isn't completed as directed, we may need to reschedule, and neither

42
00:01:56.200 --> 00:01:56.560
of us

43
00:01:56.560 --> 00:01:57.920
wants that.

44
00:01:57.920 --> 00:02:01.760
Please drink plenty of liquids throughout the process to prevent dehydration.

45
00:02:01.760 --> 00:02:05.520
Staying hydrated will help you feel better and help the prep do its job.

46
00:02:05.520 --> 00:02:09.110
If you experience any discomfort from frequent trips to the bathroom, applying

47
00:02:09.110 --> 00:02:10.000
a petroleum-based

48
00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:13.000
ointment or diaper rash cream can really help.

49
00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:14.000
That's it.

50
00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:15.480
You've got this.

51
00:02:15.480 --> 00:02:19.080
Follow the timing, finish the full dose, and stay hydrated.

52
00:02:19.080 --> 00:02:22.240
If you have any questions at all, don't hesitate to call our office.

53
00:02:22.240 --> 00:02:22.840
We're here to help.
